            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hospitalisation is an opportunity for frailty in the elderly to be detected. The collaboration of the assessment and prevention geriatrician-nurse partnership, combined with the skills of the advanced practice nurse in gerontology, helps to instil a culture of frailty prevention in the teams and create adapted care pathways.</AbstractText>
